  "summary": "M0 safety foundation, review 3 close-out complete. Enforces central deletion lock in PurgeEngine for Play/cloud builds. Implements 4-state visibility (PRESENT, ABSENT, TRASHED, UNKNOWN) with media-type specific permission evaluation; guarded disconnect and cancellation semantics in PhotosUploadWorker and DriveCloudBackup with session identity and stream abort; real Room v4-to-v5 upgrade test on native SQLite database with sentinel records for all 7 tables, schema validation, and reopen; session query recovery orchestrator tests across 5 HTTP/transport boundaries; non-empty purge cancellation request counter; truthful JUnit XML results with explicit skip annotations audited by tools/audit_junit.py; and reproducible evidence packaging.",
